<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="el">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Υγειόπολις | Αρχική</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;700&family=Roboto:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { 
            margin: 0; 
            padding: 0; 
            font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif; 
            overflow: hidden; 
        }

        /* Φόντο με θόλωμα και χαμηλή φωτεινότητα */
        .bg-image {
            background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519494026892-80bbd2d6fd0d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1500&q=80');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            height: 100vh;
            width: 100%;
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            filter: blur(10px) brightness(0.6); 
            z-index: -1;
            transform: scale(1.1);
        }

        /* Toolbar (Navbar) */
        .custom-navbar {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95) !important; 
            border-bottom: 4px solid #0056b3; 
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            padding: 10px 0;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        .navbar-brand {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #003366 !important; 
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .brand-logo {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            margin-right: 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        .nav-link {
            color: #333 !important; 
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-left: 20px;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        .nav-link:hover {
            color: #0056b3 !important;
        }

        /* Responsive μενού (δεξιά στοίχιση) */
        @media (max-width: 991.98px) {
            .navbar-collapse {
                background-color: transparent !important; 
                text-align: right; 
            }
            .nav-link {
                margin-left: auto !important; 
                padding: 12px 0 !important;
                border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
                display: block;
                width: fit-content; 
            }
        }

        /* Κεντρικό περιεχόμενο */
        .content-overlay {
            height: calc(100vh - 70px); 
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .main-title {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            font-size: 6rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #ffffff;
            letter-spacing: 15px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            text-shadow: 4px 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); 
        }

        .sub-title {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: #f0f0f0;
            margin-top: -10px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
        }

        /* Κουμπί γρήγορης πρόσβασης στη Διαλογή */
        .triage-btn {
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding: 12px 35px;
            border: 2px solid #dc3545;
            background-color: rgba(220, 53, 69, 0.2);
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 30px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
        }

        .triage-btn:hover {
            background-color: #dc3545;
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(220, 53, 69, 0.5);
        }

        /* Footer Styles */
        .custom-footer {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            border-top: 2px solid #0056b3;
            padding: 10px 0;
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 0;
            width: 100%;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        .footer-text {
            font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #003366;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .ntua-logo-img {
            height: 45px; 
            width: auto;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="bg-image"></div>

    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg custom-navbar">
        <div class="container">
            <a class="navbar-brand" href="/">
                <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2966/2966327.png" alt="Hospital Logo" class="brand-logo">
                YGEIOPOLIS
            </a>
            
            <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarNav">
                <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
            </button>
            
            <div class="collapse navbar-collapse justify-content-end" id="navbarNav">
                <ul class="navbar-nav">
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/patients">Ασθενείς</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/staff">Προσωπικό</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/triage">Triage (Διαλογή)</a></li> <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/departments">Τμήματα</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/pharmacy">Φαρμακείο</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="content-overlay">
        <h1 class="main-title">YGEIOPOLIS</h1>
        <p class="sub-title">Γενικό Νοσοκομείο «Υγειόπολης»</p>
        <a href="/triage" class="triage-btn">Επείγοντα Περιστατικά</a>
    </div>

    <footer class="custom-footer">
        <div class="container d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
            <div class="footer-text">
                Βάσεις Δεδομένων 2026 | Ονομα1, Ονομα2
            </div>
            <div class="footer-logo">
                <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/el/6/6d/%CE%95%CE%B8%CE%BD%CE%B9%CE%BA%CF%8C_%CE%9C%CE%B5%CF%84%CF%83%CF%8C%CE%B2%CE%B5%CE%B9%CE%BF_%CE%A0%CE%BF%CE%BB%CF%85%CF%84%CE%B5%CF%87%CE%BD%CE%B5%CE%AF%CE%BF.svg" alt="NTUA Logo" class="ntua-logo-img">
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>